{"updated":"2026-11-08T16:59:50.206Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfeK7uskxg6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfeK7uskxg6","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"讓 AI Agent 變成像素小員工，在辦公室裡幫你寫程式！🤣\n\n它能把 Claude Code 的工作狀態變成可愛的像素角色，直接在 VS Code 或瀏覽器裡打造一間 AI 辦公室！\n\n👨‍💻 每個 AI Agent 都有自己的角色與座位\n⌨️ 寫程式、讀檔案、執行指令都有對應動畫\n💬 AI 卡住或需要授權時，角色會跳出提示\n🏢 自由布置辦公室、家具、地板，還能養寵物\n🤖 支援顯示 Sub-agents 與 Agent Teams\n🌐 提供 VS Code 擴充套件與獨立 CLI 版本\n\n最有趣的是，當你同時開好幾個 Claude Code Agent，就像在經營一間迷你軟體公司，看著員工們各自忙碌！😂\n\n以後寫程式根本是在玩像素風經營遊戲！\n#ClaudeCode #AIAgent #OpenSource #VSCode #PixelArt","timestamp":"2026-11-08T07:00:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfeK7r1E-We","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfeK7r1E-We","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/pixel…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-08T07:00:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcSA5DE5Js","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA5DE5Js","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做 2D 遊戲最崩潰的，不是寫程式，而是角色動畫要一幀一幀畫\n\n只要提供角色描述，就能透過 AI Agent 產生遊戲用的角色素材與動畫。\n\n🎨 AI 生成角色，維持不同動作的外觀一致性\n🏃 自動製作待機、走路、跑步、攻擊等動畫\n🪄 將影片轉成透明背景的 Sprite Sheet、PNG、GIF\n🗺️ 支援生成 2D 地圖與像素風格素材\n🎮 可匯出 Godot、Aseprite 與網頁遊戲素材\n🤖 支援 Claude Code、Codex、Grok\n\n#AI #GameDev #PixelArt #OpenSource #ClaudeCode","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfcSA6AE83B","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfcSA6AE83B","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/0x0fu…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfYj5X-k7zX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5X-k7zX","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"持股已經綠到有牛在上面吃草了","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfYj5VgEyWr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfYj5VgEyWr","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"malilion.github.io/cow-p…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:43:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Dfe7Bw6iHMq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe7Bw6iHMq","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"00年卡通回憶殺✨你看過幾部？👀\n1️⃣ 真珠美人魚\n2️⃣ 飛天小女警\n3️⃣ 小魔女doremi\n4️⃣ 魔女的考驗\n5️⃣ 膽小狗英雄\n6️⃣ 大嘴鳥\n7️⃣ 校園嬌娃\n\n你最喜歡的一部是？🙌","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:00:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":23,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":25,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe7D6xiP-G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe7D6xiP-G","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"還有哪些卡通是你的童年回憶呢？🥹\n原文來自✨00年卡通回憶殺✨你看過幾部？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多女孩的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:01:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe0GWfjUj3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe0GWfjUj3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"海綿寶寶是不是很幸福的人？\n一位卡友分享：以前小時候看海綿寶寶，就很羨慕他的生活\n能有一棟屬於自己的超大房子，加上過去對烹飪很有興趣\n所以看到海綿寶寶是速食店的廚師\n一個人熟練地煎著蟹堡\n就很希望未來能當個快樂的廚師，做著喜歡的工作。\n\n但隨著年紀增長，發現海綿寶寶的生活不只令人嚮往\n更重要的是，我覺得他是個非常知足的人。\n\n他能有一顆正向樂觀的心，與最好的朋友派大星\n享受著快樂自在的生活，不用為了生活而煩惱。\n永遠保有一顆正向的心。\n\n大家覺得卡友說得中肯嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-08T13:00:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":49,"replies":1,"reposts":2,"shares":10},"score":57,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe0HjADVZ7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfe0HjADVZ7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家嚮往海綿寶寶的生活嗎？🥹\n原文來自✨海綿寶寶是不是很幸福的人？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多心情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-08T13:00:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfetRdRD-FE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetRdRD-FE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"放上你拍過最特別的雲！😍☁️\n一位卡友分享拍到看起來很像snoopy的雲\n大家覺得像嗎？🤣","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:00:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":6,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":29,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfetTewj4bw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetTewj4bw","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"來看看誰拍到的雲最特別🤩\n原文來自✨很像Snoopy的雲✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:01:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfetUz6j-gj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetUz6j-gj","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B20卡友分享：花瓶岩和花瓶雲 (˵˚ ω ˚˵)","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:01:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfetWECj5qg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfetWECj5qg","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B8卡友分享：去年出去玩拍到的🐢","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:01:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"Dfe2GgQCmDM","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfe2GgQCmDM","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"M5 Ultra 鬼武者極高畫質","timestamp":"2026-11-08T13:18:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfexJJ1FFKt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfexJJ1FFKt","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"畫人物不必只靠文字描述！Open Pose & Costume 可依姿勢、服裝與人物篩選參考，部分動作還有多視角與深度圖。程式碼開源不代表圖片可任意商用，自建素材及衍生圖限非商用。怎麼挑圖、組合與確認授權？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:34:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfexJlxlNTr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfexJlxlNTr","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:34:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":261,"replies":31,"reposts":22,"shares":185},"score":389,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe_a1BH9tN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfe_a1BH9tN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"圖文版上架囉！","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"陪客戶做夢(O)\n陪客戶做自動化(X)\n\n最近對於 AI 模型的進步突然有感而發\n五個月前，同一個客戶需求\n用當時的 opus 只能跑出 6x% 的成功率\n\n而現在只需要 sonnet 5.5 \n就能跑出 99% 以上的成功率\n\n這個場景是客戶流程的一大痛點\n他們會收到一份超多頁的 pdf\n以往都需要人工逐頁處理跟登打\n\n現在因為他們導入了新的 ERP 系統\n系統本身也能很簡單的就跟 AI 做串接\n又享受到 AI 模型的進步\n\n只需要在系統裡面做一部：上傳\n接著就放手交給 AI + 系統處理\n一個 PDF → 一百多筆資料 → 全自動出現在系統\n同仁只需要確認那些 AI 回報信心程度較低的項目就好\n\n一個小時的工作只剩下不到幾分鐘！\n如果你想知道這是哪套 ERP 系統 ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"歡迎洽詢 Odoo ERP \n找 @lupus_rr 評估自己的公司是否適合換成 Odoo\n\n享受簡單易用、又能根據需求客製化的 ERP 系統","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":46,"replies":3,"reposts":3,"shares":77},"score":61,"first_seen":"2026-11-09T01:00:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}